"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image28729696\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/b5991347fbb0.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(-1%, -9%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image28662104\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/3d5231859c5a.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(2%, -6%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"100\" dom2webgl=\"image28687946\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/d660f3e0d93c.jpg\"/></div><div class=\"w-1/3 flex-no-shrink mr-4\" style=\"transform: translate(1%, -9%)\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1 js-slider-item\" crossorigin=\"\" data-z=\"-100\" dom2webgl=\"image28704663\" draggable=\"false\" src=\"/media/21060e74cf47.jpg\"/></div></div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/9655229e634f.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2852\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-2/3@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nThe Brief\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-2/3@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nSwedish game development studio Cult of the North approached us to design their new website, the missing piece of their rebrand from Seider to Cult of the North. The website needed to embody the spirit of their new brand and capture the imagination of their target audience. The website was intended primarily as a recruitment tool and therefore needed to peak the interest of gamers, creators, and enthusiasts who share a love for immersive storytelling and unforgettable gaming experiences.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<a class=\"btn btn--regular btn--fill btn--light js-btn\" data-btn=\"fill\" data-cursor=\"hide\" href=\"https://www.cultofthenorth.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<span class=\"btn__inner js-btn-inner\">\n<span class=\"btn__content js-btn-content\">\n<span class=\"d-flex flex-row items-end\">\n<span class=\"btn__text\">\nVisit Website\n</span>\n<svg class=\"btn__icon d-inline-block js-btn-icon\">\n<use xlink:href=\"/assets/images/img-687f48138f.svg#arrow\"></use>\n</svg>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/85130509eb0e.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2849\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1 mb-5 mb-10@md\">\n<img alt=\"\" animate-from=\"preset: 'webglParallaxEffect'\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" dom2webgl=\"image28486aaa79b51e489\" src=\"/media/40509ef915e9.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-start\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nGamified website navigation \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nWe had identified early on with the client that the page navigation was the best opportunity to inject a creative gamified experience into the website, and so our concepting efforts focussed initially on this area of the website.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/4f61e39ecb04.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2873\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"grid flex-no-wrap@sm items-center\">\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/b869f5ceb103.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2882\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-10/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"t-1.3 t-2.25@sm t-300 t-lh-1.2 t-ls-tight\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nTechnical Insights \n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-10/12@sm mb-2 mb-0@sm\">\n<div class=\"\">\n<p animate-from=\"preset: 'webglTextReveal'\" class=\"mb-0\" dom2webgl=\"c:TextReveal\">\nIf you’d like to know more about the process behind creating this website along with a more detailed look at some of the more challenging technical features of the website then make sure you take a look at our project ‘Insights’ article. \n</p>\n<div class=\"mt-2\">\n<a class=\"btn btn--regular btn--fill btn--light js-btn\" data-btn=\"fill\" data-cursor=\"hide\" href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"\">\n<span class=\"btn__inner js-btn-inner\">\n<span class=\"btn__content js-btn-content\">\n<span class=\"d-flex flex-row items-end\">\n<span class=\"btn__text\">\nRead more\n</span>\n<svg class=\"btn__icon d-inline-block js-btn-icon\">\n<use xlink:href=\"/assets/images/img-687f48138f.svg#arrow\"></use>\n</svg>\n</span>\n</span>\n</span>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto w-1/1\">\n<video animate-from=\"preset: 'webglPeelEffect'\" autoplay=\"\" class=\"d-block w-1/1\" crossorigin=\"\" data-src=\"/media/24df60b7d5d9.mp4\" dom2webgl=\"image2874\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\"></video>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"testimonial w-1/1 w-1/1@sm mb-5 mb-10@sm\">\n<div class=\"container my-5 my-10@md\">\n<h2 class=\"t-1.3 t-2@sm t-uppercase mb-0 t-500\">From The Client</h2>\n<div class=\"testimonial__text-box mt-1 pt-1 mb-1.5\">\n<p class=\"w-1/1 t-2 t-3@sm t-lh-1 t-500 mb-0\">\n“If you want an awesome experience both from a product and client perspective – you should most definitely work with Nocturne Studio.\nThey took our creative vision and translated it perfectly.”\n</p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"t-uppercase t-base t-1.3@sm t-500\">\nAdam Schaub – CEO &amp; Co-Founder Cult of the North\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"container d-flex@sm items-center justify-center mb-5 mb-20@sm\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm mb-6 mb-0@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: 30, rotationZ: 3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '30%' : 0 }, rotationY: 10, rotationZ: -3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/69bca9576775.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/3@sm relative\">\n<div class=\"aspect aspect--1/1 aspect--3/2@sm\">\n<div animate-from=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '0%' : 0 }, rotationY: -30, rotationZ: -3, scrollTrigger: { scrub: 0.5, once: false }\" animate-to=\"y: function() { return store.mq.sm.matches ? '-10%' : 0 }, rotationY: -10, rotationZ: 3\" class=\"aspect__child\" data-tex-type=\"image\" dom2webgl=\"c:PhoneModel\">\n<img alt=\"\" crossorigin=\"\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/media/4bc9589b1ba8.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-1/1@sm | js-awards\">\n<div class=\"container my-5 d-block d-flex@sm my-10@md overflow-hidden\">\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-2/5@sm pr-0 pr-3@sm relative\">\n<h2 class=\"t-lh-1.1\">\n<span class=\"pl-0.25 t-serif t-italic t-500 t-2 t-3@sm\">Awards &amp; <br/></span>\n<span class=\"t-sans t-500 t-2 t-3@sm\">Recognition</span>\n</h2>\n<div class=\"award-trophy absolute fill w-1/1 h-1/1\" dom2webgl=\"c:Awards\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/1 w-3/5@sm pt-1 pt-5@sm user-select-none\">\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"css\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>CSSDA</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nSite of the Day\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"award | js-award\" data-award-model=\"fwa\">\n<div class=\"d-flex py-1 | js-award-inner\">\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<h3 class=\"t-base t-uppercase mb-0\"><span class=\"award__arrow | js-award-arrow\"><span>⮡  </span></span>FWA</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"w-1/2\">\n<p class=\"t-small t-uppercase mb-0\">\nSite of the Day\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
